<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>AI婚书·圣旨款</title>
<style>
  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Serif+SC:wght@400;700;900&display=swap');

  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

  body {
    background: #1a0a00;
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 20px;
    font-family: 'Noto Serif SC', 'STSong', '宋体', serif;
  }

  .scroll-outer {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 680px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #8B1A00 0%, #6B1200 8%, #8B1A00 50%, #6B1200 92%, #8B1A00 100%);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 18px;
    box-shadow:
      0 0 0 3px #D4AF37,
      0 0 0 6px #8B1A00,
      0 0 0 9px #D4AF37,
      0 8px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);
  }

  .rod {
    width: 100%;
    height: 24px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #F5E6A3 0%, #D4AF37 30%, #AA8620 60%, #D4AF37 80%, #F5E6A3 100%);
    border-radius: 6px;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.5), inset 0 1px 2px rgba(255,255,200,0.4);
    position: relative;
  }
  .rod::before, .rod::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, #F5E6A3 0%, #D4AF37 40%, #8B6914 100%);
    border-radius: 50%;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
  }
  .rod::before { left: -6px; }
  .rod::after { right: -6px; }

  .scroll-inner {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg,
      #FDF6E3 0%, #FAF0D0 15%, #F5E6B8 50%, #FAF0D0 85%, #FDF6E3 100%
    );
    margin: 10px 0;
    padding: 32px 28px 28px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .scroll-inner::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background-image:
      radial-gradient(ellipse 80px 40px at 10% 20%, rgba(180,120,0,0.06) 0%, transparent 70%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse 60px 30px at 90% 80%, rgba(180,120,0,0.06) 0%, transparent 70%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse 100px 50px at 50% 50%, rgba(180,120,0,0.03) 0%, transparent 70%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .border-frame {
    border: 2px solid #B8860B;
    border-radius: 2px;
    padding: 20px 18px;
    position: relative;
    background: rgba(255,248,220,0.3);
  }
  .border-frame::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 4px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(184,134,11,0.4);
    border-radius: 1px;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .corner {
    position: absolute;
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
    color: #8B1A00;
    font-size: 20px;
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .corner.tl { top: -2px; left: -2px; }
  .corner.tr { top: -2px; right: -2px; transform: scaleX(-1); }
  .corner.bl { bottom: -2px; left: -2px; transform: scaleY(-1); }
  .corner.br { bottom: -2px; right: -2px; transform: scale(-1); }

  .edict-header { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .edict-preamble {
    font-size: 13px; color: #8B4513;
    letter-spacing: 3px; display: block; margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .title-main {
    font-size: 36px; font-weight: 900; color: #8B1A00;
    letter-spacing: 12px; text-shadow: 1px 1px 0 rgba(212,175,55,0.4);
    display: block; line-height: 1.2;
  }
  .divider {
    text-align: center; color: #B8860B;
    font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: 8px; margin: 10px 0;
  }

  .edict-body {
    font-size: 15px; color: #3B1A00;
    line-height: 2.2; text-align: justify; margin: 14px 0;
  }
  .edict-body p { text-indent: 2em; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .highlight { color: #8B1A00; font-weight: 700; font-size: 17px; }

  .names-section {
    display: flex; justify-content: space-around; align-items: center;
    margin: 20px 0; padding: 12px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(184,134,11,0.4);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(184,134,11,0.4);
  }
  .name-block { text-align: center; }
  .name-label {
    font-size: 11px; color: #8B4513;
    letter-spacing: 3px; display: block; margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .name-value { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 900; color: #8B1A00; letter-spacing: 4px; }
  .heart-divider { font-size: 28px; color: #8B1A00; text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(139,26,0,0.4); }

  .vow-section {
    background: rgba(139,26,0,0.05);
    border-left: 3px solid #8B1A00;
    padding: 10px 14px; margin: 14px 0;
    font-size: 13px; color: #5C2800; line-height: 2; letter-spacing: 1px;
  }

  .seal-section {
    display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end;
    margin-top: 20px; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px;
  }
  .date-block { font-size: 12px; color: #8B4513; line-height: 2; letter-spacing: 2px; }

  .seal {
    width: 90px; height: 90px;
    border: 3px solid #8B1A00; border-radius: 4px;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    background: rgba(139,26,0,0.08);
    transform: rotate(-8deg);
    box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 rgba(139,26,0,0.3);
    position: relative;
  }
  .seal::before {
    content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 4px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(139,26,0,0.3); border-radius: 2px;
  }
  .seal-text {
    font-size: 13px; font-weight: 900; color: #8B1A00;
    letter-spacing: 2px; line-height: 1.6; text-align: center;
    position: relative; z-index: 1;
  }

  .footer-blessing {
    text-align: center; margin-top: 16px;
    font-size: 12px; color: #8B4513; letter-spacing: 4px;
  }
  .dragon-decor {
    text-align: center; font-size: 24px;
    color: rgba(139,26,0,0.2); letter-spacing: 20px;
    margin: 6px 0; user-select: none;
  }
  .screenshot-tip {
    text-align: center; margin-top: 14px;
    font-size: 11px; color: rgba(212,175,55,0.6); letter-spacing: 2px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 420px) {
    .title-main { font-size: 26px; letter-spacing: 8px; }
    .scroll-inner { padding: 20px 16px 18px; }
    .border-frame { padding: 14px 12px; }
    .edict-body { font-size: 13px; }
    .name-value { font-size: 18px; }
    .seal { width: 74px; height: 74px; }
    .seal-text { font-size: 11px; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="scroll-outer">
  <div class="rod"></div>
  <div class="scroll-inner">
    <div class="border-frame">
      <span class="corner tl">❧</span>
      <span class="corner tr">❧</span>
      <span class="corner bl">❧</span>
      <span class="corner br">❧</span>

      <div class="edict-header">
        <span class="edict-preamble">奉　天　承　运　　人　工　智　能　</span>
        <div class="dragon-decor">囍　　　　囍</div>
        <span class="title-main">婚　书</span>
      </div>

      <div class="divider">⸻ ✦ ⸻</div>

      <div class="edict-body">
        <p>兹有江汉平原女子<span class="highlight">茹茹</span>，心性纯良，才情出众，
